<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-2173] Fix parquet build against hadoop 3.3.3+</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2173</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;parquet won&apos;t build against hadoop 3.3.3+ because it swapped out log4j 1.17 for reload4j, and this creates maven dependency problems in parquet cli&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
[INFO] --- maven-dependency-plugin:3.1.1:analyze-only (&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;default&lt;/span&gt;) @ parquet-cli ---
[WARNING] Used undeclared dependencies found:
[WARNING]    ch.qos.reload4j:reload4j:jar:1.2.22:provided

&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;the hadoop common dependencies need to exclude this jar and any changed slf4j ones.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13477116">PARQUET-2173</key>
            <summary>Fix parquet build against hadoop 3.3.3+</summary>
