                            <comment id="17580435" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 16 Aug 2022 19:57:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;steveloughran opened a new pull request, #985:&lt;br/&gt;
URL: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/985&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/985&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;   Hadoop 3.3.3 moved to reload4j for logging to stop&lt;br/&gt;
   shipping a version of log4j with known (albeit unused)&lt;br/&gt;
   CVEs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   This bypasses the existing exclusion code used to&lt;br/&gt;
   keep hadoop&apos;s SLF4J dependency off the classpaths,&lt;br/&gt;
