	&lt;li&gt;&amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;slf4j-log4j12&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
+            &amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;*&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Review Comment:&lt;br/&gt;
   it means that &lt;br/&gt;
   1. classic log4j is excluded&lt;br/&gt;
   2. slf4j-reload4j is excluded&lt;br/&gt;
   3. when the hadoop move to log4j2 is finally shipped, its slf4j bindings will be excluded too.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   exclusions 1 and 2 could be done explicitly, but #3 is unclear until something ships. (hadoop trunk/3.4 is on log4j2, but the move isn&apos;t complete)&lt;/p&gt;


</comment>
